  "solution": {
    "text": "Heat absorbed by gas in three processes is given by<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mtext>ACB</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">W</mtext><mtext>ACB</mtext></msub></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mtext>ADB</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mtext>AEB</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">W</mtext><mtext>AEB</mtext></msub></math><br /><br />The change in internal energy in all the three cases is the same and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>ACB</mi></msub></math> is positive, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>AEB</mi></msub></math> is negative.<br /><br />Hence&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mtext>ACB</mtext></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mtext>ADB</mtext></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext><mtext>AEB</mtext></msub></math>"
  }
